+        thinking-disabled requests happens at prompt inspection, before the
+        first token) the reasoning parser is never consulted again. Parsers
+        that implement ``route_late_content`` can still claim reasoning
+        markup appearing in that content - e.g. agent-tuned checkpoints
+        that reopen a <think> block mid-answer, which would otherwise reach
+        the client verbatim. Parsers without the hook are unaffected.
+        """
+        route = getattr(self._reasoning_parser, "route_late_content", None)
+        if route is None or (not content and not finished):
+            return None, content
+        return route(content or "", finished=finished)
